      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Nice try ;) You tell me\n\nIs this a problem singleton solves?\n- If you want a single class to store\nstrings you should think carefully if this \nis appropriate. Do you want each class to\nmanage it's own reference string or do you\nwant a central place to store these?",
      "baseline": 189,
