      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. To save memory by only creating & using one instance of a class \n2. To reduce the work required by Java Garbage collection by reducing the number of unused instances\n3. To provide all classes access to a single instance of a class  \n4. Just because you can",
      "baseline": 167,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. To save memory by only creating & using one instance of a class \n2. To reduce the work required by Java Garbage collection by reducing the number of unused instances\n3. To provide all classes access to a single instance of a class  \n4. Just because you can",
      "index": "aV",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 961,
      "versionNonce": 1894363795,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "An1NNhHj5TNTXRHtg-uW6",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": -4915.679890770142,
      "y": 6339.171147413587,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 482,
      "height": 175,
      "seed": 547504860,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1747093505147,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "2. Part of the use of generics is the powerful\ntype-checking ability. These reference types are \nchecked at compile type vs run time.\n\nCompile time (when classes are compiled)\nRun time (when the main program is run)\n",
      "baseline": 168,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Part of the use of generics is the powerful\ntype-checking ability. These reference types are \nchecked at compile type vs run time.\n\nCompile time (when classes are compiled)\nRun time (when the main program is run)\n",
      "index": "aW",
