      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Implement singleton for Level so that I can access it universally\n2. Use strategy pattern to create multiple movement strategy for Player\n3. Use factory method to seperate creation logic of Entity from usage of Entity\n4. Use Template method to re-factor duplicate code in sub classes into my parent class",
      "baseline": 168,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
