      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "- Documentation is often overlooked and shouldn't be synonymous with just commenting.\n- Comments help programmers that are coding with you to understand and digest the written code,\n  while documentation is primarily for programmers that intend to USE your program.\n\n\n\n\ne.g., javadoc\n\nJavaDoc is a command-line tool provided with the java \ndevelopment kit, which is able to automatically generate \ndocumentation from a special type of comment.\n\nThe Bagel documentation is actually generated\n from JavaDoc!",
      "baseline": 60,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Documentation is often overlooked and shouldn't be synonymous with just commenting.\n- Comments help programmers that are coding with you to understand and digest the written code,\n  while documentation is primarily for programmers that intend to USE your program.\n\n\n\n\ne.g., javadoc\n\nJavaDoc is a command-line tool provided with the java \ndevelopment kit, which is able to automatically generate \ndocumentation from a special type of comment.\n\nThe Bagel documentation is actually generated\n from JavaDoc!",
      "index": "am",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2678571428571428
    },
