      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Coupling:\nThe degree of interaction between modules must be reduced\nas much as possible. Designs should have low coupling.",
      "baseline": 166,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Coupling:\nThe degree of interaction between modules must be reduced\nas much as possible. Designs should have low coupling.",
