      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "What is an Enum?\n- An enum (short for enumeration) is a special data type in Java.\n- It defines a fixed set of constant values.\n\nExample:",
      "baseline": 60,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is an Enum?\n- An enum (short for enumeration) is a special data type in Java.\n- It defines a fixed set of constant values.\n\nExample:",
