      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Why Use Enums?\n\n- Improves code readability and safety.\n- Prevents invalid values (e.g., only allows predefined constants).\n- Easier to maintain than multiple constant variables.",
      "baseline": 25,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why Use Enums?\n\n- Improves code readability and safety.\n- Prevents invalid values (e.g., only allows predefined constants).\n- Easier to maintain than multiple constant variables.",
      "index": "b0U",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
