      "text": "Open-closed Principle:\nModules should be open to extension, but closed to \nmodification.",
      "baseline": 17,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Open-closed Principle:\nModules should be open to extension, but closed to \nmodification.",
