      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Polymorphism:\nThe ability to use an object or method in many different ways;\nachieved in Java through ad hoc (overloading), subtype (overriding),\nand parametric (generics) polymorphism.",
      "baseline": 166,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Polymorphism:\nThe ability to use an object or method in many different ways;\nachieved in Java through ad hoc (overloading), subtype (overriding),\nand parametric (generics) polymorphism.",
